.DS_Store
*.log

# Compiled CLI binaries produced by `deno task build` / `deno compile`.
/dist/

# Coverage and scratch output.
/coverage/
/.scratch/

# Internal strategy notes (not shipped, may reference private codebases).
/notes/

# --- discern harness ---
# Compiled agent files are generated by `discern guidelines` from discern's
# built-in guidance + your [guidance].sources. AGENTS.md is intentionally left
# tracked so guidance changes show up in diffs and review; the other provider
# mirrors are regenerated artifacts and are not committed.
/CLAUDE.md
/GEMINI.md
# Everything under .claude/ is generated or ephemeral — the materialized skills
# (.claude/skills/, copied/symlinked by `discern guidelines`) and the linked
# worktree checkouts created by the worktree hooks — EXCEPT your settings, which
# are tracked. (Leaving the worktree checkouts tracked would make the main
# checkout read "dirty" the moment a worktree is created, blocking graduation.)
/.claude/*
!/.claude/settings.json
!/.claude/settings.local.json
